id: S05
target: src/sello/scalar.nim
desc: geAdd: sign flip in the Edwards addition formula's X output, computed via feAdd instead of feSub.
====OLD====
  feSub(r.x, A, B)          # X = (Y+X)(Yq+Xq) - (Y-X)(Yq-Xq)
====NEW====
  feAdd(r.x, A, B)          # X = (Y+X)(Yq+Xq) - (Y-X)(Yq-Xq)
====END====
